  "body": "## Changelog\n### New Features\n* 55d9a7b9dc4f16b7fe61667f9efe436b263f936d: feat(verify): Add --var-values flag (#1288) (@jalseth)\n* 81f1ce43020776590e48d4b2bc6007a1940ea2ab: feat: support glob wildcards in --namespace (#1343) (@arpitjain099)\n### Bug Fixes\n* cd348b82ce3c0c47cf0202601a5cbda8da992ea9: fix(ci): update setup-regal action to open-policy-agent org (#1368) (@boranx)\n* 0e38a953f2fb55991f82de6010d1657ef7865fa7: fix(verify): default `--show-builtin-errors` to false (#1325) (@dgeorgievski)\n### OPA Changes\n* c0aceef9eef680db2d07d3cfd1a0f4fcfa275b2a: build(deps): bump github.com/open-policy-agent/opa from 1.15.2 to 1.17.1 (#1346) (@dependabot[bot])\n* a41c3a98810a12bfbb5661ed160f0261977a958b: build(deps): bump github.com/open-policy-agent/opa from 1.17.1 to 1.18.2 (#1363) (@dependabot[bot])\n* 4130398ce1505a13585d9141bfec9e601995466b: build(deps): bump github.com/open-policy-agent/opa to v1.19.0 (#1385) (@johanfylling)\n### Other Changes\n* 6b381ad117c5d6b178c6a7cb99921c17bad34569: Pre commit conftest docs integration (#1263) (@jrottenberg)\n* 107ec8ea6bb3d6035254ba25118ab7e2a3211477: build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6.0.1 to 6.0.3 (#1352) (@dependabot[bot])\n* 0b9a9beb9dceed10b89e514a41d5e082abae802c: build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6.0.3 to 7.0.0 (#1358) (@dependabot[bot])\n* a2ddb015db9ac283edb1b70664654d3d8957cf6b: build(deps): bump alpine from 3.23.3 to 3.23.4 (#1316) (@dependabot[bot])\n* cbe17f264c09dc76007e9bf8e661ce1413d78064: build(deps): bump alpine from 3.23.4 to 3.24.0 (#1351) (@dependabot[bot])\n* 15ddb9dd1025178f2879f9bcecb35502189575c4: build(deps): bump alpine from 3.24.0 to 3.24.1 (#1357) (@dependabot[bot])\n* 313bf0ae76445d58cb3aa0421df49850b3939af5: build(deps): bump cachix/install-nix-action from 31.10.1 to 31.10.6 (#1329) (@dependabot[bot])\n* cab3aa189d8810147765c8fb99e40d514f1b7fc5: build(deps): bump cuelang.org/go from 0.16.0 to 0.16.1 (#1310) (@dependabot[bot])\n* bee01de3d03c3fcf3033cfadd75010db34d09ec3: